[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10140.15, "timestamp": "02:49:00", "text": "最好的东西。嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10142.87, "timestamp": "02:49:02", "text": "我只是觉得，嗯，我觉得在……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10144.63, "timestamp": "02:49:04", "text": "早上我只是好奇而已"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10146.71, "timestamp": "02:49:06", "text": "值得一看的东西，看看是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10149.67, "timestamp": "02:49:09", "text": "日语就是关于男人的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10152.15, "timestamp": "02:49:12", "text": "你有很多东西，比如很多东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10154.63, "timestamp": "02:49:14", "text": "摆在你面前。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10157.19, "timestamp": "02:49:17", "text": "是的，平假名和片假名是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10161.269, "timestamp": "02:49:21", "text": "分开，但是汉字 h 我不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10165.11, "timestamp": "02:49:25", "text": "你肩上的担子很重。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10168.23, "timestamp": "02:49:28", "text": "汉字太多了，我必须集中精力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10171.269, "timestamp": "02:49:31", "text": "汉字其实很慢很慢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10174.71, "timestamp": "02:49:34", "text": "在这方面做得更好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10176.15, "timestamp": "02:49:36", "text": "你会成功的，你是个勤奋的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10178.15, "timestamp": "02:49:38", "text": "知道你可以拥有，是的，你可以拉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10182.95, "timestamp": "02:49:42", "text": "关掉它，别担心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10184.55, "timestamp": "02:49:44", "text": "H"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10187.67, "timestamp": "02:49:47", "text": "我可以，我不知道。这就像一份礼物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10189.19, "timestamp": "02:49:49", "text": "或者别的什么。我能看出人们的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10191.67, "timestamp": "02:49:51", "text": "性格远早于正常人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10194.71, "timestamp": "02:49:54", "text": "习惯之类的。是的，我知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10196.79, "timestamp": "02:49:56", "text": "比如应该避开谁，应该和谁交谈等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10199.269, "timestamp": "02:4